        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the old bouncing <strong><i>DvD</i></strong> screensaver?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wished it was an idle game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPRESENTING:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><i>DvD</i></strong> Idle Game, an nostalgic 2000's idle game with bouncing <strong><i>DvD's</i></strong>, increasing profits and lots of extra 2000's like technology implemented in an idle game</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Shops:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DVD</i> Shop</strong> – Upgrade speed, multiplier, number of discs, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dial-Up Internet</strong> – Activate for bandwidth multipliers. Upgrade delay, duration, and power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> – Unlock new disc colors, visual filters, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DVD</i> Burner</strong> – Burn your progress to unlock powerful upgrades and new shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viruses</strong> – Stop the viruses before they destroy your discs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torrenting </strong>-<strong> </strong>Download music with your bandwidth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CD Burning</strong> – burn CDs from your torrented music, and sell them for profit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more...</strong> hidden secrets, upgrades, and surprises await.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of Achievements: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tons of achievements—can you collect them all?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the old bouncing <strong><i>DvD</i></strong> screensaver?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wished it was an idle game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPRESENTING:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><i>DvD</i></strong> Idle Game, an nostalgic 2000's idle game with bouncing <strong><i>DvD's</i></strong>, increasing profits and lots of extra 2000's like technology implemented in an idle game</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Shops:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DVD</i> Shop</strong> – Upgrade speed, multiplier, number of discs, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dial-Up Internet</strong> – Activate for bandwidth multipliers. Upgrade delay, duration, and power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> – Unlock new disc colors, visual filters, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DVD</i> Burner</strong> – Burn your progress to unlock powerful upgrades and new shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viruses</strong> – Stop the viruses before they destroy your discs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torrenting </strong>-<strong> </strong>Download music with your bandwidth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CD Burning</strong> – burn CDs from your torrented music, and sell them for profit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more...</strong> hidden secrets, upgrades, and surprises await.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of Achievements: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tons of achievements—can you collect them all?</p>",
        "short_description": "Remember the old bouncing DvD screensaver? Well now its an idle game, Bounce DvD's all over the screen and increase your profits, and a lot of 2000's technology will come up as shops",
